  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "What are we doing in a place like this?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074002000610072006500200077006500200064006F0069006E006700200069006E0020006100200070006C0061006300650020006C0069006B006500200074006800690073003F00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This is that Hyperspace Lumiose thing, right?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680069007300200069007300200074006800610074002000480079007000650072007300700061006300650020004C0075006D0069006F007300650020007400680069006E0067002C002000720069006700680074003F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m gathering our presence here is a reflection of\nsomeone’s subconscious thoughts.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lucky me—I have some questions I’ve been\nwanting to ask you, Team Flare Nouveau!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSo how about a battle? If I win, you tell me\neverything I want to know.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 160
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lend me a hand here, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0065006E00640020006D006500200061002000680061006E006400200068006500720065002C00200010000201000000002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Of course!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006600200063006F007500720073006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hold on...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F006C00640020006F006E002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You want to scope out the situation before we\nstart battling? Smart move.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>If <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> and I join forces,\nwe’re<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsure<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nto<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwin<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthis!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 17,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD060000004900660020001000020100000000200061006E0064002000490020006A006F0069006E00200066006F0072006300650073002C000A0077006520190072006500100001BE00000A007300750072006500100001BE00000A0074006F00100001BE00000A00770069006E00100001BE00000A0074006800690073002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I admit that my resentment at not being chosen\nby Zygarde does still smolder a little, deep down.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI’d be glad for the chance to battle you again, so\nI might sweep away the ashes of such regrets.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 202
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m not about to say no to a battle. Just know that\nif you lose, I’m putting you to work for me.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, I’m gonna win",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006C006C002C002000492019006D00200067006F006E006E0061002000770069006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wait, not right now",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006100690074002C0020006E006F00740020007200690067006800740020006E006F00770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My fire isn’t meant to smolder. It is meant to burn\nbright!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007900200066006900720065002000690073006E201900740020006D00650061006E007400200074006F00200073006D006F006C006400650072002E0020004900740020006900730020006D00650061006E007400200074006F0020006200750072006E000A006200720069006700680074002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Charizard! Let your dark flames pour forth!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430068006100720069007A00610072006400210020004C0065007400200079006F007500720020006400610072006B00200066006C0061006D0065007300200070006F0075007200200066006F007200740068002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then what are we even doing here?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065006E0020007700680061007400200061007200650020007700650020006500760065006E00200064006F0069006E006700200068006500720065003F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Get ready to be burned to the ground!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470065007400200072006500610064007900200074006F0020006200650020006200750072006E0065006400200074006F0020007400680065002000670072006F0075006E0064002100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I want to know more about Team Flare from the\nold days—back when Dr. Xerosic was with them.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’re going to burn so bright, we’ll be blinding.\nLet’s ignite with Mega Evolution, Charizard!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nouveau is all about building a new life for\nourselves! Let’s Mega Evolve into something new!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My Pokémon and I aren’t alone—my old mentors\nhave our backs in spirit!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We won. I take it you won’t object to answering a\ncouple questions now?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Naturally.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00610074007500720061006C006C0079002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tell me... Do you know why Dr. Xerosic was\nworking for Team Flare?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065006C006C0020006D0065002E002E002E00200044006F00200079006F00750020006B006E006F00770020007700680079002000440072002E0020005800650072006F0073006900630020007700610073000A0077006F0072006B0069006E006700200066006F00720020005400650061006D00200046006C006100720065003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I know the doctor was working on a way to\nenhance humans’ abilities—not unlike how<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMega Evolution powers up Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThe result of his research was the Expansion Suit.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 178
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We were planned to be his very first test subjects.\nAt some point, however, those plans changed.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nI don’t know why, but you took our place.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve got nothing to add. Never had much to do\nwith the guy.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004920190076006500200067006F00740020006E006F007400680069006E006700200074006F0020006100640064002E0020004E006500760065007200200068006100640020006D00750063006800200074006F00200064006F000A007700690074006800200074006800650020006700750079002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The doctor was always kind to me... I wish I knew\nmore about who he was as a person.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I believe Xerosic valued his research above all\nelse...and yet he did show kindness to you.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "People in general are walking self-contradictions.\nCan’t expect ’em to always make sense, right?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Remember him how you wish to",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065006D0065006D006200650072002000680069006D00200068006F007700200079006F00750020007700690073006800200074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I don’t think his kindness was a lie",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200064006F006E201900740020007400680069006E006B00200068006900730020006B0069006E0064006E0065007300730020007700610073002000610020006C006900650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks! That’s comforting to hear.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061006E006B00730021002000540068006100742019007300200063006F006D0066006F007200740069006E006700200074006F00200068006500610072002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And here is a little thank-you gift from me.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI feel more at peace now with Zygarde’s choice.\nYour actions make it clear why you were the one.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 149
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You received Grisham’s Chef Top Set!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007200650063006500690076006500640020004700720069007300680061006D201900730020004300680065006600200054006F0070002000530065007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you ever come to lend a hand at Nouveau Café,\nmake sure you put that on and dress the part.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>No, no. <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> will be much\ntoo<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbusy<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfor<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthat.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁHShe has h<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂiser own role to play in serving the people\nand Pokémon of our city.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 21,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 154
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I will not hold you to any obligation to come help\nat the café.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDo, however, feel free to stop by anytime you like.\nWe are always around to offer our support.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 6080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 166
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It is remarkable, isn’t it? All around Lumiose City,\nboth people and Pokémon can find their own path<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nand thrive in so many different ways.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This Hyperspace Lumiose thing is...pretty drab.\nWho subconsciously yearns for a place like this?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Working as a detective has allowed me to engage\nwith the city and its people in so many ways.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt’s such an interesting line of work!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    }
  ],
